cies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- working in: 4.4\n- not working in: 4.5, 4.5.1, 4.6-dev1\n\n### System information\n\nUbuntu 24.04.3 LTS 24.04 on X11\n\n### Issue description\n\nChanging interface theme via EditorScript stopped working after upgrade to Godot version 4.5. It was working before on 4.4. The below is the editor script that I use as a quick shortcut to switch between dark and light themes.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCode:\n\n```\n@tool\nextends EditorScript\nclass_name ChangeTheme\n\nconst THEME_LIGHT = \"Light\"\nconst THEME_DARK = \"Default\"\nconst PROPERTY = \"interface/theme/preset\"\n\nfunc _run():\n\tvar settings = EditorInterface.get_editor_settings()\n\tvar current_theme = settings.get_setting(PROPERTY)\n\t\n\tif current_theme == THEME_LIGHT:\n\t\tsettings.set_setting(PROPERTY, THEME_DARK)\n\t\tprint(\">>> Dark theme selected\")\n\telif current_theme == THEME_DARK:\n\t\tsettings.set_setting(PROPERTY, THEME_LIGHT)\n\t\tprint(\">>> Light theme selected\")\n\telse:\n\t\tprint(\">>> Unknown theme\")\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nn/a","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https:/